{
  "id": "002",
  "title": "Blind Date Self introduction",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2015-11-13",
  "synopsis": "A good self introduction is important to make a good first impression. In this lesson we see Tom introducing himself for arranged marriage.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/2/c2d0146be113687dfc41a9ce93a73b3168469d39.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "自我介绍（相亲）\n\n    大家好！我叫汤姆，今年23岁，来自美国。很高兴能参加这次的相亲聚会。\n    我喜欢打篮球，游泳等运动，但有时我也喜欢宅在家里玩电脑。我希望找到一个爱笑的，能给我带来快乐的女朋友。谢谢大家。",
    "traditional": "自我介紹（相親）\n\n    大家好！我叫湯姆，今年23歲，來自美國。很高興能參加這次的相親聚會。\n    我喜歡打籃球，游泳等運動，但有時我也喜歡宅在家裡玩電腦。我希望找到一個愛笑的，能給我帶來快樂的女朋友。謝謝大家。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Self introduction (arranged marriage)"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "大家好！",
      "traditional": "大家好！",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我叫汤姆，今年23岁，来自美国。",
      "traditional": "我叫湯姆，今年23歲，來自美國。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jiào tāng mǔ jīn nián 3 suì lái zì měi guó",
      "english": "Hi everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "很高兴能参加这次的相亲聚会。",
      "traditional": "很高興能參加這次的相親聚會。",
      "pinyin": "hěn gāo xìng néng cān jiā zhè cì de xiāng qīn jù huì",
      "english": "My name is Tom. I'm 23 years old this year and come from America."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I'm very happy to be able to join you at this arranged matchmaking party."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我喜欢打篮球，游泳等运动，但有时我也喜欢宅在家里玩电脑。",
      "traditional": "我喜歡打籃球，游泳等運動，但有時我也喜歡宅在家裡玩電腦。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xǐ huan dǎ lán qiú yóu yǒng děng yùn dòng dàn yǒu shí wǒ yě xǐ huan zhái zài jiā lǐ wán diàn nǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我希望找到一个爱笑的，能给我带来快乐的女朋友。",
      "traditional": "我希望找到一個愛笑的，能給我帶來快樂的女朋友。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xī wàng zhǎo dào yí ge ài xiào de néng gěi wǒ dài lái kuài lè de nǚ péng you",
      "english": "I like playing basketball, swimming and other sports, but I also enjoy staying at home playing on the computer sometimes."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "谢谢大家。",
      "traditional": "謝謝大家。",
      "pinyin": "xiè xie dà jiā",
      "english": "I am looking for a girlfriend who loves to laugh and can bring me happiness."
    }
  ],
